    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a corrupt and hostile library with the task of extracting forbidden knowledge from its tomes. Triumph over the entities that linger within, in this Action-Adventure FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DREADTOME is a short game made by a team of third-year university students.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365910/extras/ac24332b095788194135df198b31540a.poster.avif?t=1753525764\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365910/extras/ac24332b095788194135df198b31540a.webm?t=1753525764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365910/extras/ac24332b095788194135df198b31540a.mp4?t=1753525764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your repulser, firearm, and environmental hazards in strategic ways to dispatch the corrupted creatures that roam the library.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome trials of the mind in order to upgrade your tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the labyrinthian library to replenish resources and uncover the story that unfolded before your arrival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle varying enemy types, each with their own unique dangers.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a corrupt and hostile library with the task of extracting forbidden knowledge from its tomes. Triumph over the entities that linger within, in this Action-Adventure FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DREADTOME is a short game made by a team of third-year university students.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365910/extras/ac24332b095788194135df198b31540a.poster.avif?t=1753525764\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365910/extras/ac24332b095788194135df198b31540a.webm?t=1753525764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365910/extras/ac24332b095788194135df198b31540a.mp4?t=1753525764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your repulser, firearm, and environmental hazards in strategic ways to dispatch the corrupted creatures that roam the library.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome trials of the mind in order to upgrade your tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the labyrinthian library to replenish resources and uncover the story that unfolded before your arrival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle varying enemy types, each with their own unique dangers.</p></li></ul>",
